# The Hit 40 km/h goal fires on a tucked bomb down the lab hill during a run (40 km/h = 11.1 m/s,
# reached on the 10% section), and not on the flat at push speed.
park lab
spawn lab_hill_top
cmd 0 run start
hold up 0..240
hold ollie 240..1400
run 1400
expect event goal{goal=Hit 40 km/h} within 300..1400
expect no event bail
